{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102100","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1910210001:0":{"text":"依照过往时间推算，下潜大概会在一周后开始。保险起见，最好还是再收集些养料。","source_cn":"依照过往时间推算，下潜大概会在一周后开始。保险起见，最...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0EA89E73872B08","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254442","variant_female_record_index":"254443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910210002:0":{"text":"集会结束后，我会和壳拉流斯、艾星特拉一起把养料送过去，再对<style=\"highlight\">繁育池</style>与<style=\"highlight\">母瑚</style>进行最后一次检查。","source_cn":"集会结束后，我会和壳拉流斯、艾星特拉一起把养料送过去，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x54B08120D93A9DFF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254444","variant_female_record_index":"254445","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910210003:0":{"text":"嗯？海月家的小客人，找我有什么事吗？","source_cn":"嗯？海月家的小客人，找我有什么事吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCB9B61BF52204FBD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254446","variant_female_record_index":"254447","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1910210003":{"text":"嗯？海月家的小客人，找我有什么事吗？","source_cn":"嗯？海月家的小客人，找我有什么事吗？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCB9B61BF52204FBD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"254446","variant_female_record_index":"254447","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910210004:0":{"text":"看来近几日海月家族事务繁忙，摩淖亚还没来